ds_list_add(textList, "Jessie, a member of the criminal organization Team Rocket,", "Often showed her admirable side:", "She would often employ a glorious Mallet against her partner in crime, James.", "This was instrumental in helping the trio Blast Off Again!", "Now, this museum doesn't make a habit of endorsing unrepentant criminals like Team Rocket...", "But for Jessie, we'll make the exception.")